---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Stevie Thomas"
  description="Hitting trainer at Driveline Baseball, working on swing mechanics, bat tracking, and public baseball data."
>
  <section style="padding: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem) 0 0;">
    <img
      class="about-portrait reveal"
      src="/images/stevie-thomas.jpg"
      alt="Stevie Thomas"
      style="--i:0"
    />
    <p class="eyebrow reveal" style="--i:1">About</p>
    <h1 class="reveal" style="--i:2">Stevie Thomas</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        My name is Stevie Thomas. I'm currently a hitting trainer with Driveline Baseball. After
        finishing my collegiate baseball career across UMD, CUA, and UConn, while earning my
        bachelor's in Biomedical Engineering, I decided to pursue baseball as a full-time career.
      </p>
      <p>
        As an uncoordinated, unathletic, and nerdy kid, baseball was never easy for me. I developed
        my passion for data-driven development in high school when I discovered how people were
        using technology to bridge the gap between the ungifted athletes like myself and the
        uber-talented athletes of the world. The beauty of technology in sports is that it
        democratizes access to high performance for anyone with the drive and intelligence to
        properly utilize it. I want to share that beauty with the world.
      </p>
      <p>I am currently interested in and exploring:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>How to best utilize my experience and technical background to get elite athlete results</li>
        <li>Inter-swing variability in hitters</li>
        <li>Developing an app to play hitting games using real-time Hittrax and Blast Motion data</li>
        <li>Motor Learning and Ecological Dynamics</li>
        <li>Greatness in my Sunday Men's League</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Elsewhere</h3>
      <ul class="linklist">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/mesteviet25">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://x.com/stevie_t12">X / @stevie_t12</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/stevie_t12/">Instagram / @stevie_t12</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
